1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stefano_Visconti en.wikipedia] : Stefano Visconti (kneeling). Portrait from his grave.
2 CONT * In 1318 he married Valentina Doria, 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT *http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stefano_Visconti
2 CONT
2 CONT Stefano Visconti († 4. Juli 1327) aus der Familie Visconti war der dritte Sohn des Matteo I. Visconti, des Herrn über Mailand.
2 CONT
2 CONT Er heiratete 1318 Valentina Doria, Tochter des Bernabo, und hatte mit ihr vier Söhne:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Bernabò Visconti (1319-1385)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Galeazzo II. Visconti (um1320-1378)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Matteo II. Visconti († 1355)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Giovanni Visconti,
2 CONT
2 CONT unter die das Herrschaftsgebiet der Familie 1354 nach dem Tod des Kardinals Giovanni Visconti aufgeteilt wurde.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT NOTA BENE: I have made this duplicate profile of Stefano Visconti, since the merged one has as the grandfather, Pope Gregory X, born Theobaldo Visconti. However, there seems to be a homonym error. I then attached our family tree t
2 CONC o this corrected person, not linked to the Pope, until such time as the error can be cleared up.
2 CONT
2 CONT From the Pope's profile: '''NOTA BENE (March 14, 2017): there may be a homonym error here. 
2 CONT # A certain Theobaldo Visconti, born in 1230 and also deceased in 1276 seems to be more likely the father of Matteo, father of Stefan.
2 CONT # It seems highly unlikely that the father of the Pope woud be around 10 years old (born 1200) at the birth of the Pope
2 CONT # Pope Gregory X does not show on Wikipédia lists of Popes having had children Anyone with further information and/or help in clearing this up - please feel free to contact any of us managing this profile. Thanks. MP
2 CONT
2 CONT '''
