2 CONT
2 CONT Leopold III, Duke of Austria
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 23 February 1365 to Viridis Visconti (1352–1414), second eldest daughter of Barnabò Visconti, Lord of Milan and Beatrice Regina della Scala, and had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT William
2 CONT
2 CONT Leopold
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernest the Iron
2 CONT
2 CONT Frederick
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth (1378–1392)
2 CONT
2 CONT Katharina (1385–?) Abbess of St. Klara in Wien
