2 CONT '''By Elisabeth of Bavaria-Landshut''', daughter of Henry XVI of Bavaria '''(married Stuttgart 8 February 1445)''' died 1 January 1451
2 CONT Margarethe         			1445-1450	21 July 1479	became a nun at Liebenau monastery.[13]	[14]
2 CONT Eberhard VI[15]			1 February 1447	17 February 1504	married Elisabeth of Brandenburg in 1467.	[16]
