2 CONT ==Ulrich V Graf von Württemberg1 
2 CONT '''M, #43022, b. 1413, d. 1 September 1480'''
2 CONT Last Edited=13 Nov 2011
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.01%
2 CONT '''Ulrich V Graf von Württemberg was born in 1413.2 He was the son''' of Eberhard IV Graf von Württemberg and Henriette von Mömpelgard.3,2 '''He married, firstly, Margareta von der Mark-Kleve''', daughter of Adolf I Graf von der M
2 CONC ark Herzog von Kleve und Graf van Ravensberg and Marie de Valois-Bourgogne, '''in 1441.2 He married, secondly, Elisabeth von Bayern-Landshut''', daughter of Heinrich XVI Herzog von Bayern-Landshut and Margarete von Habsburg, '''on
2 CONC  8 February 1445 at Stuttgart, Baden-Württemburg, Germany.2 He married, thirdly, Margherita Principessa di Savoia-Achaea''', daughter of Amadeo VIII Duca di Savoia and Marie de Valois-Bourgogne, '''on 11 November 1453 at Stuttgart
2 CONC , Baden-Württemburg, Germany.2 He died on 1 September 1480 at Leonberg'''G.3,2
2 CONT '''Ulrich V Graf von Württemberg also went by the nick-name of Ulrich 'the Beloved'.3 He succeeded as the Herzog von Württemberg in 1419.'''3
