2 CONT ==Ulrich V. “Der Vielgeliebte” von Württemberg
2 CONT '''Birth	1413'''
2 CONT '''Death	1 Sep 1480 (aged 66–67)'''
2 CONT '''Burial	Stiftskirche Stuttgart'''
2 CONT '''Stuttgart-Mitte, Stadtkreis Stuttgart, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 43654430
2 CONT '''Also called "The Much Loved". Count of Württemberg. His mother was''' Henriette von Mömpelgard (1384-1444).
