2 CONT '''     Jean, Duke de Torraine, Berry was born on 31 August 1398 at Paris, France.1 He and Jacqueline of Holland obtained a marriage license on 22 April 1411; Date of Dispensation for being related in the 3rd and 4th degrees.2 Jea
2 CONC n, Duke de Torraine, Berry married Jacqueline of Holland''', daughter of Wilhelm VI, Count of Holland, Hennegau, Seeland, & Straubing, Lord of Arkel and Margarethe de Burgundy, '''on 6 August 1415 at Den Haag, Netherlands.1,3 Jean
2 CONC , Duke de Torraine, Berry died on 5 April 1417 at Compiegne, France, at age 18; Poisoned; buried at Abbey of St. Corneille.'''1,3,2
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Jacqueline of Holland''' b. 16 Jul 1401, d. 9 Oct 1436
