2 CONC  de France|b. 21 Jan 1337\nd. 16 Sep 1380|p10314.htm#i103139|Jeanne de Bourbon|b. 3 Feb 1338\nd. 4 Feb 1378|p10314.htm#i103140|Stefan I. Herzog von Bayern-Ingolstadt|b. c 1337\nd. 25 Sep 1413|p347.htm#i3465|Thaddea Visconti|b. c 1
2 CONC 350\nd. 28 Sep 1381|p348.htm#i3477|
2 CONT
