2 CONT
2 CONT i)         ''' FRANÇOIS Bérenger de Sassenage '''(-[1447/49], bur Grenoble Jacobin church).  Baron de Sassenage.  Seigneur de Pont-en-Royans et de Montellier.  Courcelles records his parentage, his founding a chapel in the Jacobin
2 CONC  church of Grenoble in 1440 where he was buried, and his testament dated 1447 which named “Hugues de la Tour seigneur de Vinay tuteur de Jacques son fils”[2072].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' PHILIPPA Alleman, daughter of GUIGUES Alleman Seigneur de Champ & his wife Guicharde Alleman de Séchilienne (-1478).  Courcelles records her parentage and marriage, noting that she survived until 1478[2073]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   François & his wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT Not known father of https://www.geni.com/people/William-Berenger/6000000194175841865
2 CONT
2 CONT   Source or explanation PLZ 
