2 CONT
2 CONT Louis XII
2 CONT
2 CONT King of France and Naples; Duke of Brittany; Count of Provence
2 CONT
2 CONT King of France
2 CONT
2 CONT Reign 	7 April 1498 – 1 January 1515
2 CONT
2 CONT Coronation 	27 May 1498, Reims
2 CONT
