1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Doubtful descendance, as it only comes forth out of genealogical papers from the descending families of de Succa, Leva, etc. 
2 CONT
2 CONT A contract of marriage of Guillaume Visconti's daughter is given but describes her as the daughter of one Guillaume Thyssens. The authors claim this is a patronym ( "Son of Thys", or Matthieu in French), and thus linking to the Mi
2 CONC lanese Visconti family. 
2 CONT
2 CONT However, patronyms were not used in this flexible fashion anymore in 15th century Antwerp. They changed into non-flexible patronyms (=last/family names) long before that. Therefore, this claimed patrilineal ascendance from the Bra
2 CONC bant' Visconti/de Succa/etc families is doubtful yet officially adhered to in grants and recognitions of nobility. 
2 CONT
