2 CONT '''Helena von Württemberg was born circa 1460. She married Kraft VI, Graf von Hohenlohe''', son of Kraft V, Graf von Hohenlohe and Margaret von Oettingen, '''on 26 February 1476 at Waldenburg, Hohenlohe, Baden-Württemberg, Germany
2 CONC .1,3 Helena von Württemberg died on 19 February 1506; Buried at Öhringen Church.'''1,3
2 CONT '''Family	Kraft VI, Graf von Hohenlohe''' d. 2 Aug 1503
