2 CONT ==Helena von Württemberg
2 CONT '''Birth	1457'''
2 CONT '''Stuttgart, Stadtkreis Stuttgart, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT '''Death	19 Feb 1506 (aged 48–49)'''
2 CONT '''Heilbronn, Stadtkreis Heilbronn, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT '''Burial	Stiftskirche St. Peter und Paul'''
2 CONT '''Öhringen, Hohenlohekreis, Baden-Württemberg, Germany'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 158558287
2 CONT '''Helene von Wurttemberg married Kraft VI, Graf zu Hohenlohe on 26 February 1476, in Waldenburg, Öhringen, Württemberg, Germany. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 6 daughters. She died on 19 February 1506, in Jagstkrei
2 CONC s, Württemberg, Germany, at the age of 49, and was buried in Heilbronn, Baden-Württemberg, Germany.'''
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT '''Graf Kraft VI. zu Hohenlohe'''
2 CONT 1442–1503
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Kraft Ulrich zu Hohenlohe
2 CONT unknown–1481
2 CONT
2 CONT Helena zu Hohenlohe
2 CONT unknown–1483
2 CONT
2 CONT Helena zu Hohenlohe
2 CONT unknown–1543
2 CONT
2 CONT Albrecht III. zu Hohenlohe
