2 CONT '''Crato VI''' ; Born 1445 Neuenstein Second son of Crato V [de] and Margaret of Oettingen [bg] ; '''Consort Helena of Württemberg [de] 26 February 1476 Waldenburg seventeen children'''
2 CONT '''Children''' Albert III [de] 1478, George I [de] 1488
2 CONT
