2 CONT * [http://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I13460&tree=2 finnholbek get person]
2 CONT *'''Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg, Princes of Calenberg and Göttingen:''' with his brother [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-III-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000006727820957 Frederick III the Turbulent] 1473–1483	
2 CONT * '''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Wilhelm-I-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000003827363880 William the Victorious] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-III-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000006727820
2 CONC 957 Frederick III the Turbulent]
2 CONT *'''Duke of Brunswick-Luneburg, Prince of Wolfenbüttel:''' with his brother [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-III-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000006727820957 Frederick III the Turbulent] until 1483, Reign 1482–1491
2 CONT * '''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Wilhelm-I-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000003827363880 William the Victorious] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Heinrich-I-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000001317317467
2 CONC  Henry the Evil] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-I-von-Braunschweig-L%C3%BCneburg/6000000004402473166 Eric I] 	
2 CONT *'''Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg, Prince of Calenberg:''' Reign 1484–1491
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-III-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000006727820957 Frederick III the Turbulent] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Heinrich-I-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/60000000013
2 CONC 17317467 Henry the Evil] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-I-von-Braunschweig-L%C3%BCneburg/6000000004402473166 Eric I]
2 CONT *'''Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg, Princes of Göttingen:''' Reign 1484–1495
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-III-von-Braunschweig-Luneburg/6000000006727820957 Frederick III the Turbulent] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Erich-I-von-Braunschweig-L%C3%BCneburg/600000000
2 CONC 4402473166 Eric I]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Furst Wilhelm II efterträdde fadern 1482 jämte sin bror Fredrik och blev 1483 även hertig av Göttingen. Då Fredrik visade sig vara sinnessjuk satte Wilhelm denne i förvar i Münden 1485, och Fredrik dog där utan arvingar 1495. 
2 CONT Wilhelm överlät styret av furstendömet Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel åt sönerna redan 1491. Vid Fredriks död 1495 delade Wilhelm samma år upp sin fars arv mellan sina egna söner Henrik och Erik.
