2 CONT Renée de France, Duchess of Ferrera, Modena and Reggio (25 October 1510 – 12 June 1574) was the younger daughter of Louis XII of France and Anne, Duchess of Brittany. Her elder sister was Queen Claude of France. She was the Duches
2 CONC s of Ferrara due to her marriage to Ercole II d'Este, grandson of Pope Alexander VI.
