2 CONT '''Leone''' (1476 - Milan 1496), between the end of 1495 and the beginning of 1496 married the young noblewoman Margherita Grassi,[125] already widow of his uncle Giulio Sforza, to whom he had given a son.[126] He died shortly aft
2 CONC er the wedding without having had offspring.[127] He is often confused with his [https://www.geni.com/people/Leone-Sforza-abate-di-S-Vittore/6000000081868944232 ''''cousin''''] of the same name, the latter abbot of San Vittore in 
2 CONC Vigevano since 1495.
