1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There seems to be some different possibilities for the spouse of Philipp Volland, and the mother of Caspar Volland
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Christian Wolff, Les Ancêtres d'Albert Schweitzer (Strasbourg (5, rue Fischart, 67000) : Publications du C.G.A., 1978., Philipp Volland is
2 CONT *14620. Philipp VOLLAND, * Markgröningen (Wurt.) 1472/73, x 1537, étudiant à Heidelberg 1489, bachelier 1492, riche marchand de vin, Vogt de Markgr. 1501-19 ; lors des troubles en Wurtemberg, il s'exila 1519 à Pforzheim, dont le m
2 CONC argrave de Bade le nomma prévôt du lieu à nouveau 1534-37 ; oo v. 1490 and was married to:
2 CONT *14621. (Lucia) LAST, * Tubingue v. 1465, x ap. 1499, dernière du nom
2 CONT
2 CONT According to [http://gw.geneanet.org/emig?lang=en;pz=christian+charles+theodore;nz=emig;ocz=0;p=lucie;n=von+nippenburg Christian Emig's tree] Philpp Volland was married to:
2 CONT * [http://www.geni.com/people/Lucie-von-Nippenburg/6000000031834194631 Lucie von NIPPENBURG]
2 CONT
2 CONT I have asked Christian Emig about this and a few other differences between his and Christian Wolff's work and he says that some of that has been shown incorrect since that was published in 1978 and Christian Emig believes his tree
2 CONC  on Geneanet is more accurate. I will connect these individuals according to Christian Emig's tree.  
