1 OCCU Crowned Emperor of Austria in 1493; married Isabella, daughter of Emperor Ferdiand, of Spain, and thereby acquired a right to the crown of Spain in 1506; aka Philip the Handsome, m. 8-21-1496, King of Castille and Leon., King of C
