2 CONT *'''Sir Edward Plantagenet, Prince of Wales, Duke of Cornwall, Earl of Chester & Flint1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8
2 CONT *'''M, #48411, b. 13 October 1453, d. 4 May 1471
2 CONT *Father	Henry VI Plantagenet, King of England & France9,10 b. 6 Dec 1421, d. 21 May 1471
2 CONT *Mother	Margaret de Anjou1,9,10 b. 23 Mar 1430, d. 25 Aug 1482
2 CONT *'''     Sir Edward Plantagenet, Prince of Wales, Duke of Cornwall, Earl of Chester & Flint was born on 13 October 1453 at Westminster, London, Middlesex, England.1,2,3,6 He married Anne Neville''', daughter of Sir Richard 'the Ki
2 CONC ng Maker' Neville, 1st Earl Warwick, 2nd Earl Salisbury, Lord Bergavenny, Glamorgan, & Morgannwg, Sheriff of Worcestershire, Admiral of England, Ireland, & Aquitaine, Chamberlain of the Exchequer and Anne Beauchamp, '''circa 13 De
2 CONC cember 1470 at Amboise, Indre-et-Loire, Centre, France; No issue.1,2,11,12,3,4,5,6,7,8 Sir Edward Plantagenet, Prince of Wales, Duke of Cornwall, Earl of Chester & Flint died on 4 May 1471 at Battle of Tewksbury, Gloucestershire, 
2 CONC England, at age 17; Buried at Tewkesbury Abbey, Gloucestershire.1,2,3,5,6,8
2 CONT *'''Family     Anne Neville''' b. 11 Jun 1456, d. 16 Mar 1485
2 CONT *Citations
