2 CONT *'''Helen Tudor1 
2 CONT *'''F, b. circa 1455
2 CONT *Father    Sir Jasper Tudor, Earl of Pembroke, Duke of Bedford2 b. c 1431, d. 21 Dec 1495
2 CONT *'''     Helen Tudor was born illegitimate circa 1455; She is illegitimate. Her mother is unknown. Her husbands were half brothers.1 She married William Gardiner, Esq., son of Sir Thomas Gardiner, circa 1475.1 Helen Tudor married 
2 CONC John Gardiner, son of Sir Thomas Gardiner, after 1506.3
2 CONT *'''Family 1     William Gardiner, Esq. b. c 1452, d. a 1506
2 CONT *'''Family 2     John Gardiner b. c 1470
