1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Christoph, Duke of Württemberg=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Ulrich, Duke of Württemberg and Sabine Herzogin von Bayern
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1544, at the age of 29, '''Christoph married Anna Maria of Brandenburg-Ansbach,''' daughter of George , through the mediation of his father . 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The couple had the following children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Eberhard''' (* 7 January 1545 in Mömpelgard; † 2 May 1568 in Göppingen)
2 CONT * '''Hedwig''' (* 15 January 1547 in Basel; † 4 March 1590 in Marburg); ⚭ Ludwig IV of Hesse-Marburg
2 CONT * '''Elisabeth''' (* 3 March 1548 in Mömpelgard; † 18 February 1592 in Durlach); ⚭ 1. Georg Ernst Count of Henneberg-Schleusingen , ⚭ 2. Georg Gustav Count Palatine of Veldenz-Lauterecken
2 CONT * '''Sabina''' (* July 2, 1549 in Mömpelgard; † August 17, 1581 in Rotenburg an der Fulda); ⚭ William IV of Hesse-Kassel
2 CONT * '''Emilie''' (* 19 August 1550 in Montbéliard; † 4 June 1589 in Simmern); ⚭ Reichard, Count Palatine of Simmern
2 CONT * '''Eleonore''' (* 22 March 1552 in Tübingen; † 12 January 1618 in Lichtenberg); ⚭ 1. Joachim Ernst I, Prince of Anhalt , ⚭ 2. George I of Hesse-Darmstadt
2 CONT * '''Ludwig''' I (* 1 January 1554 in Stuttgart; † 28 August 1593 in the same place) succeeded his father as Duke.
2 CONT * '''Maximilian''' (* 27 August 1556 in Stuttgart; † 17 March 1557 in the same city)
2 CONT * '''Ulrich''' (* March 11, 1558 in Stuttgart; † July 7, 1558 in the same city)
2 CONT * '''Dorothea Maria''' (born September 3, 1559 in Stuttgart; died March 13, 1639 in Hilpoltstein); married Otto Heinrich, Count Palatine of Sulzbach
2 CONT * '''Anna''' (* 12 June 1561 in Stuttgart; † 7 July 1616 in Haynau); ⚭ 1. Johann Georg von Ohlau und Wohlau , ⚭ 2. Friedrich IV. von Liegnitz
2 CONT * '''Sophie''' (* 20 November 1563 in Stuttgart; † 21 July 1590 in Vacha ); ⚭ Frederick William I, Duke of Saxe-Altenburg
2 CONT
