2 CONT '''Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn'''1
2 CONT Last Edited	20 Mar 2002
2 CONT F, #57196, '''b. 7 January 1528, d. 9 June 1572'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Henri II d' Albret, King of Navarre, Comte de Foix & Bigorre2 b. 24 Apr 1503, d. 29 May 1555
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Marguerite d' Orleans, Duchess d'Alencon & Berry3 b. 11 Apr 1492, d. 21 Dec 1549
2 CONT '''     Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn was born on 7 January 1528 at Pau.1 She married Antoine de Bourbon, 2nd Duke of Vendome, King of Navarre''', son of Sir Charles IV de Bourbon, Duke of Vendome, Count
2 CONC  of Soissons, Marle, Conversano and Francoise d' Alencon, '''on 20 October 1548 at Moulins, France.1 Jeanne III d' Albret Queen of Navarre, Princess of Bearn died on 9 June 1572 at Paris, France, at age 44; Buried at St. Georges, 
2 CONC Vendome.'''1
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Antoine de Bourbon, 2nd Duke of Vendome, King of Navarre''' b. 22 Apr 1518, d. 17 Nov 1562
