1 NAME Pietro Martire /Rusca/
2 GIVN Pietro Martire
2 _MARNM Rusca
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1480
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lugano
3 STAE TI
3 CTRY Switzerland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1578
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 convento di S.Domenico
3 CITY Cremona
3 STAE Lombardia
3 CTRY Italy
1 OCCU
1 TITL inquisitor
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dictionary of heretics, dissidents and inquisitors in the Mediterranean world - Edizioni CLORI | Florence | ISBN 978-8894241600 | DOI 10.5281 / zenodo.1309444 http://www.ereticopedia.org/pietro-martire-rusca
2 CONT
2 CONT >Pietro Martire Rusca , also known as Pietro Martire da Lugano (Lugano, 1480 - Cremona, 1578) was a Dominican inquisitor.
2 CONT
2 CONT >He was prior of various Dominican convents (S. Domenico in Cremona, S. Clemente in Brescia, S. Domenico in Bologna, S. Maria delle Grazie in Milan, S. Domenico in Modena). He was Inquisitor of Como (appointed January 2, 1530) and
2 CONC  vicar of the Inquisitor of Bologna [https://www.geni.com/people/Ludovico-Beccadelli/6000000176369931954 Ludovico Beccadelli] . Under [https://www.geni.com/people/Papa-Paolo-IV/6000000031507231301 Paul IV] , of whom he was confess
2 CONC or, he was consultor of the Holy Office (his name appears for the first time in the documentation on June 3, 1557) and vicar general of the Dominican order in Rome (from August 25, 1557). He was later Inquisitor of Cremona (as suc
2 CONC h he presided over the defensive trial of [https://www.geni.com/people/Giovanni-Gerolamo-Morone-cardinal/6000000172929213813 Cardinal Giovanni Morone], which took place in Cremona at the beginning of 1560), a position from which h
2 CONC e resigned in 1564 because old age had made him blind. He died almost centenary in 1580
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------
2 CONT
2 CONT -https://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/pietro-martire-rusca_(Dizionario-Biografico)_ <br/>
2 CONT ...Alcune cronache riportano infatti che intorno agli anni Settanta del Cinquecento [https://www.geni.com/people/Papa-San-Pio-V/6000000071638439878 Pio V] lo avrebbe voluto come confessore, promettendogli la promozione alla dignit
2 CONC à cardinalizia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Quasi centenario, nel 1578 si spense nel convento di S. Domenico di Cremona.
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://www.genmarenostrum.com/pagine-lettere/letterar/rusconi/rusconi2.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT   C1. Conte Pietro Martire (* Lugano 1480 ca. + 1578), 
2 CONT
2 CONT frate domenicano a Cremona dal 1504 ca., Priore a  Cremona nel 1515, 1536 e 1542, Priore del monastero di Santa Maria delle Grazie a Milano nel 1540 e  1550, Superiore del monastero di San Domenico a Bologna, Priore provinciale do
2 CONC menicano della Lombardia 1544/1546, Inquisitore a Como, confessore del [https://www.geni.com/people/Pope-Paulus-II/6000000010293642737 Papa Paolo II] 1556/1559, Vicario dell’Ordine  dei Domenicani dal 5-1557, Definitore dell’Ordin
2 CONC e per la Lombardia nel 1564, Inquisitore a Cremona nel 1563 e 1570.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
