2 CONT *'''     Sir William Shelley is the son of John Shelley and Elizabeth Michelgrove.2 He married Alice Belknap, daughter of Sir Hamon Belknap, in 1299.1
2 CONT *'''      In 1529 Judge Court Common Pleas, knighted.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Sir William Shelley and Alice Belknap
2 CONT ** 1.John Shelley+2 d. 16 Dec 1550
