2 CONT *****				  m. John Shirley of Isefeild (b 1569, d 1631)
2 CONT *****				h. Anne Shirley (b 23.12.1573)
2 CONT *****				  m. (c1590) Sir John Tracy of Toddington, Sheriff of Gloucestershire, 1st Viscount of Rathcoole (d before 14.02.1648)
2 CONT *****				i. Cecily Shirley (bur 31.07.1662)
2 CONT *****				  m. (25.11.1596) Thomas West, 3rd Lord De La Warr (b 09.07.1557, d 07.06.1618)
2 CONT ****			ii. Anthony Shirley ## note probable duplication above
2 CONT ****			  m. Barbara Walsingham (dau of Sir Thomas Walsingham)
2 CONT *****				a. Thomas Shirley of Preston, Sussex (d 02.1636-7)
2 CONT *****				The folllowing is supported by Visitation (Susse, 1662, Shirley of Preston) with input also from BEB1841 (Shirley of Preston).
2 CONT *****				  m1. (13.06.1598) Jane Essex (bur 03.11.1599, dau of Thomas Essex of Lamburne, sister of Sir William)
2 CONT ******					(1) Thomas Shirley of Preston (bpt 31.03.1599, bur 20.05.1654)
2 CONT ******					  m. Elizabeth Stapley (dau of Drew Stapley of London)
2 CONT *******						(A) Sir Anthony Shirley, 1st Bart of Preston (b 05.07.1624, bur 22.06.1683)
2 CONT *******						m. Anne Onslow (dau of Sir Richard Onslow of West Clandon)
2 CONT ********							(i) Sir Richard Shirley, 2nd Bart of Preston (b c1654, bur 30.03.1692)
2 CONT ********							  m. (13.03.1676-7) Judith Bateman (bur 04.06.1729, dau of Joas Bateman of London, sister of Sir James, m2. Sir Henry Hatsell)
2 CONT *********								(a) Sir Richard Shirley, 3rd Bart of Preston (d unm 1705)
2 CONT *********								(b) Anne Shirley
