2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT
2 CONT The pedigree says ...
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. John Shelley of Michelgrove, Esq., the eldest son, married Mary, daughter of Sir William Fitz-Williams, Knt. and Maud his wife, daughter of Sir Richard Sackvile of Buckhurst, Knt. (who surviving him, married Sir Robert Guldefor
2 CONC d, Knt.) by whom he had two sons and six daughters. Of the daughters, 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==6, Anne,==
2 CONT
2 CONT wife to Sir Richard Shirley of Wiston, in-Sussex, Knt.
2 CONT
2 CONT however, this appears to be a confusion with an earlier generation Alma "Anne" Shelley of Michelgrove.  For example:
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. (xi) William Shirley b abt 1498 [ age 42 at time of father's death] d May 28, 1551. Buried in the chapel at Wiston. Will proved July 20, 1551 Prerogative Court of Canterbury. Heir of father in 1540 Will. He mentioned his brothe
2 CONC r, Edward, and his sisters, Frances and Jane, in his will.
2 CONT
2 CONT The dates do not align.
2 CONT
