1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Not the mother of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Browne-of-Witham/6000000006442558748?through=6000000002824565531
2 CONT * Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Browne/6000000149696903821?through=6000000002824565531, who married https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Brown-of-Bekonsfield-Bucks/6000000002824565531?through=6000000002824565587
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Gardiner was the granddaughter of Jasper Tuder. Anne was a legatee in the 1485 will of her father.   Anne was a legatee in her father's will. Magna Carta Ancestry (2011), states that she drops off the record after 19 January 
2 CONC 1487. She appears to have been unmarried at that time, as no marriage record is associated with her and her subsequent history is unknown.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT === D I S A M B I G U A T I O N
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne (b. c. 1440), dau. of William Gardner of London (b. c. 1414), wife of Robert Brown of Bekonsfield, Bucks., son of John Brown and Catherine Stoke
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
