1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Arthur, Prince of Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Catherine of Aragon 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Henry VII 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Elizabeth of York 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 20 September 1486
2 CONT
2 CONT Winchester 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 2 April 1502 (aged 15)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludlow Castle, Wales 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial Worcester Cathedral 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Arthur Tudor (19 or 20 September 1486 - 2 April 1502) was the first son of King Henry VII of England and Elizabeth of York, and therefore, heir to the throne of England and Wales. As he predeceased his father, Arthur never became
2 CONC  king. The throne was taken by his younger brother Henry, who became King Henry VIII."
2 CONT
2 CONT ==================================================================================
