3 NOTE I have often wondered whether Henry had O negative blood (rare blood group) with only I think, 17% of the world's population have this blood group.  People with this blood group do not have any of the rhesus gene. This means inter
4 CONC estingly enough there is NO relation to the rhesus monkey. This blood group are not related to monkeys as some people would like us to believe. Another interesting fact is that O negative blood can be used in blood transfusions wi
4 CONC th any other blood type. However, if a person with O negative blood needed a blood transfusion they have to match the blood from the O negative blood group as their immune system will reject any other blood type. Its true that the
4 CONC  O negative blood triggers immune responses making poor reproductive matches. These days the medical fraternity has ways of dealing with the old fear of having a "blue" baby. Some people have argued that  the term "blue" baby refe
4 CONC rs to royal blood as in s/he has "blue" blood. It is true that Prince Charles has O negative blood.
