2 CONT __________
2 CONT '''Enrique II, Rey de Navarre'''1 
2 CONT M, #113658, '''b. 18 April 1503, d. 29 March 1555'''
2 CONT Last Edited=21 Nov 2014
2 CONT '''     Enrique II, Rey de Navarre was born on 18 April 1503 at SanguesaG. He was the son of''' Juan III, Rey de Navarre and Catherine, Reina de Navarre. '''He married Marguerite d'Angoulême''', daughter of Charles d'Orléans, Comt
2 CONC e d'Angoulême and Luisa Principessa di Savoia-Piedmonte, '''on 24 January 1526. He died on 29 March 1555 at age 51.'''
2 CONT '''     He succeeded as the Rey Enrique II de Navarre in 1517.'''2
2 CONT '''Child of Enrique II, Rey de Navarre and Marguerite d'Angoulême'''
2 CONT 1. Jeanne III, Reina de Navarre+2 b. 7 Jan 1528, d. 9 Jun 1572
2 CONT Citations
