2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT John Stewart, Earl of Mar (c. 1479–March 11, 1503) was the youngest son of James III of Scotland and Margaret of Denmark. He was created Earl of Mar on March 2, 1486.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stewart had two brothers, King James IV and James Stewart, Duke of Ross. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died unmarried.
