1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne of Cleves (1515-1557), Fourth Wife of Henry VIII
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Known for: safely divorcing from Henry and surviving
2 CONT
2 CONT Also known as: Anna von Jülich-Kleve-Berg
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------------
