2 CONT Elizabeth de Valois, Princesse de France was born in 1545. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Henri II, Roi de France and Catherine de Medici. She married Felipe II von Habsburg, Rey de España, son of Karl V von Habsburg, Holy Roman Emperor and Isabel de Aviz, Infanta de Portugal, in 1559 at Palacio
2 CONC  del Infantado, Guadalajara, Spain. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1568. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth de Valois, Princesse de France gained the title of Princesse Elizabeth de France. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth de Valois, Princesse de France and Felipe II von Habsburg, Rey de España:
2 CONT
