2 CONT  Thomas Shelley Born about 1500 in Michelgrove, Sussex, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestors ancestors
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of William Shelley M.P. and Alice (Belknap) Shelley
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Edward Shelley, Elizabeth (Shelley) Copley, James Shelley, Margaret Shelley, Dorothy (Shelley) Parker, John Shelley, Katherine (Shelley) Browne and Richard Shelley MP	
2 CONT
