1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 4. (xi) William Shirley b abt 1498 [ age 42 at time of father's death] d May 28, 1551. Buried in the chapel at Wiston. Will proved July 20, 1551 Prerogative Court of Canterbury. Heir of father in 1540 Will. He ment
2 CONC ioned his brother, Edward, and his sisters, Frances and Jane, in his will. m. Mary Isley  
2 CONT children of William Shirley and Mary Isley:  
2 CONT 5. Anthony Sherley of Preston Esq.  
