2 CONT By his first wife Sir Richard had issue four sons and six daughters: viz.
2 CONT William Sherley his eldest son, Thomas, Edward, and Richard; of the three younger sons I have no further accounts; the daughters were,
2 CONT * 1. Elizabeth, who married John Mychell of Stammerham, in the parish of Horsham, in Sussex, esq.
2 CONT * 2. Alice, married Thomas Challenor of Kenwardes in Lindfield, in Sussex, esq.
2 CONT * 3. Anne, married Richard Earnfold of Wickham, in the parish of Steyning, in Sussex, esq.
2 CONT * 4. Cecilia, married Richard Leeds of Steyning (?) in Sussex, esq.
2 CONT * 5, 6. Jane and Frances were the other two daughters, who appear to have died unmarried
