2 CONC I of Spain]
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [ Maximilian II of Burgundy] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Maximilien-de-H%C3%A9nin-comte-de-Boussu/6000000000609971616 Maximilien de Hénin-Liétard]
