2 CONT *'''Wikipedia:''' [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elisabeth_of_Hesse English ]  [http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elisabeth_von_Hessen_(1539%E2%80%931582)_ Deutsch]
2 CONT
2 CONT As a matrilineal relative of Elisabeth of Luxembourg and ultimately of Nicholas II of Russia, she and all her female-line descendants are members of mitochondrial haplogroup T.
