1 NOTE {geni:about_me} As Jacobus was the Abbot of St. Martin and Maria Beatrice (Beatrix) was the Abbess.
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrix von Leiningen Spira was formerly Abbess of the nearby Cistercian Convent of St Catherine by Braunweiler, Bad Kreuznach, Rheinland-Pfaltz, Germany. During the Protestant Reformation the decision was made to disband both the
2 CONC  (Catholic) Abbey of Sponheim and the (Catholic) Convent of St Catherine. Abbot Jacobus Spira and Abbess Beatrix von Leiningen were later married, and had several children, including a son, Christoffel Spira.
2 CONT
2 CONT Provided by Anonymous
2 CONT November 12, 2018
