2 CONT
2 CONT Archduchess Maria of Austria (21 June 1528 - 26 February 1603) was the spouse of Maximilian II, Holy Roman Emperor and King of Bohemia and Hungary.[1] She was the daughter of Emperor Charles V and twice served as regent of Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
2 CONT [hide]
