1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth of Austria''' (1526-1545) was a Queen consort of Poland. She was the eldest of fifteen children of Ferdinand I, Holy Roman Emperor, and his wife Anne of Bohemia and Hungary. A member of the House of Ha
2 CONC bsburg, she was married off to Sigismund II Augustus, who was already crowned as King of Poland and Grand Duke of Lithuania even though both of his parents were still alive and well. The marriage was short and unhappy. Elizabeth w
2 CONC as of frail health, suffering from epileptic seizures, and died at age 18. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabeth_of_Austria_(1526%E2%80%931545)_ Wikipedia EN]
