1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Count Joachim von Fürstenberg-Heiligenberg, Graf=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Friedrich II von Fürstenberg, Graf and Anna von Werdenberg
2 CONT * Joachim of Fürstenberg (1538–1598) was a Count of Fürstenberg-Heiligenberg, a vassalate of the Holy Roman Empire. His wife was Countess Anna of Zimmern. He was succeeded by his son, Frederick IV of Fürstenberg.
