1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''James V Stewart, King of Scots'''  was born on  10 April 1512 in Linlithgow Palace, West Lothian, Scotland and died on  14 December 1542 in  Falkland Palace, Fife, Scotland  and was buried in Holyrood Abbey, Edi
2 CONC nburgh, Scotland, He was also known as Seumas V Stiùbhairt,
