1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Hans den yngre af Sønderborg= 
2 CONT =Johann the Younger=
2 CONT
2 CONT *Johann(Hans) of Denmark and Norway Prins
2 CONT *Duke(Herzog) of Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg in 1564. 
2 CONT *Duke(Herzog) of Schleswig-Holstein-Plön in 1564.
2 CONT *Best known as Johann the younger(Hans den yngre) of Sønderborg
2 CONT *Founder of the branch Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg, a kadet branch to the house of Oldenburg with subbranches : Ærø, Nordborg, Glücksburg and Augustenburg
2 CONT
