2 CONT
2 CONT Matthis Buser - Barbel Eglin
2 CONT
2 CONT Matthis Buser was born at Ruemlingen, Basel, Switzerland Abt 1565. His parents were Hans Buser and Anna Goetschi.
2 CONT He married Barbel Eglin Jun 1585 at Ruemlingen, Basel, Switzerland . Barbel Eglin was born at Ruemlingen, Basel, Switzerland 1568 .
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of 14 children:
2 CONT Elisabeth Buser born 5 Jan 1586.
2 CONT Mathias Buser born 12 Nov 1587.
2 CONT Jacob Buser born 25 Jan 1590.
2 CONT Verena Buser born 5 Dec 1591.
2 CONT Heinrich Buser born 23 Jul 1593.
2 CONT Barnard Buser born 13 Dec 1594.
2 CONT
