1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Dorothea Maria of Anhalt (b. Dessau, 2 July 1574 - d. Weimar, 18 July 1617), was by birth member of the House of Ascania and Princess of Anhalt and after her marriage Duchess of Saxe-Weimar.
2 CONT
2 CONT She the sixth daugther of Joachim Ernest, Prince of Anhalt but the second-born by his second wife Eleonore, daughter of Christoph, Duke of Württemberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1586, the twelve-years-old Dorothea Maria was chosen by her father as Abbess of Gernrode and Frose as the successor of her elder sister Agnes Hedwig.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1593 she was relevated of her post as Abbess in order to marry with John II, Duke of Saxe-Weimar. The wedding took place in Altenburg on 7 January of that year. Her succesor as Abbess was her niece Sophie Elisabeth, eldest daug
2 CONC hter of her half-brother John George I of Anhalt.
2 CONT
2 CONT During the twelve years of her marriage, Dorothea Maria gave birth twelve children -the last of whom was born posthumously-, included the famous general Bernhard of Saxe-Weimar and Ernst I of Saxe-Gotha.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothea Maria had an accident while riding a horse and died of the injuries at. Her funeral took place on 24 August 1617 in the Schloss Hornstein (later Wilhelmsburg Castle); in this occasion, the Fruitbearing Society was created
2 CONC  and her younger brother, Louis of Anhalt-Köthen, was appointed his first head.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wikipedia:
2 CONT
2 CONT English: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dorothea_Maria_of_Anhalt
2 CONT
2 CONT Deutsch: http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dorothea_Maria_von_Anhalt
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT War eine askanisch-anhaltische Prinzessin und von 1586 bis 1593 die 36. Äbtissin des freien wellichen Stiftes Gernrode und Frose. Sie verließ das stift für ihre Vermählung mit Johann lll. von Sachen-Weimar
2 CONT * Mit 43 Jahren verunghlückte Herzogin Dorothea Maria bei einem Reitunfall tödlich.
2 CONT * Im Gothaer Sagenschatz in der Überliefung von der Ahnherrindes Schlosses ist sie bekant wie "Die Weiße Fra auf dem Friedenstein", der Geist der verstorbenen Dorothe Maria durch die Räume der Residenz gewandelt.
2 CONT
2 CONT .
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-187494132-5-1842/sophie-dorothea-marie-princess-of-anhalt-zerbst-sachse-sachs-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy
2 CONC /18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 16 2020, 23:05:16 UTC''
2 CONT
