2 CONT ''' Maria Magdalena Erzherzogin von Österreich was born in 1589.1 She was the daughter''' of Karl II Erzherzog von Österreich and Maria Prinzessin von Bayern.1 '''She married Cosimo II de Medici, Granduca di Toscana''', son of Fer
2 CONC dinando I de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Christine de Lorraine, '''in 1608.1 She died in 1631'''.1
2 CONT '''     She gained the title of Erzherzogin von Österreich.'''
2 CONT '''Children of Maria Magdalena Erzherzogin von Österreich and Cosimo II de Medici, Granduca di Toscana'''
2 CONT 1. Ferdinando II de Medici, Granduca di Toscana+4 b. 1610, d. 1670
2 CONT 2. Giancarlo de Medici3 b. 24 Apr 1611, d. 23 Jan 1663
