0 @N6000000002188309368@ NOTE Henry VII of England
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Henry VII Tudor
1 CONT King of England, Lord of Ireland (more...)
1 CONT Portrait of Henry, holding a red Lancastrian rose, by Michael Sittow
1 CONT Portrait of Henry, holding a red Lancastrian rose, by Michael Sittow
1 CONT Reign 22 August 1485 – 21 April 1509
1 CONT Coronation 30 October 1485
1 CONT Predecessor Richard III
1 CONT Successor Henry VIII
1 CONT Consort Elizabeth of York
1 CONT among others
1 CONT Issue
1 CONT Arthur, Prince of Wales
1 CONT Margaret Tudor
1 CONT Henry VIII
1 CONT Mary Tudor
1 CONT Detail
1 CONT Titles and styles
1 CONT The King
1 CONT Earl of Richmond
1 CONT Royal house House of Tudor
1 CONT Father Edmund Tudor, 1st Earl of Richmond
1 CONT Mother Lady Margaret Beaufort
1 CONT Born 28 January 1457(1457-01-28)
1 CONT Pembroke Castle, Wales
1 CONT Died 21 April 1509 (aged 52)
1 CONT Richmond Palace, England
1 CONT Burial Westminster Abbey, London
1 CONT English Royalty
1 CONT House of Tudor
1 CONT
1 CONT Royal Coat of Arms
1 CONT Henry VII
1 CONT    Arthur, Prince of Wales
