0 @N6000000002188342065@ NOTE Arthur, Prince of Wales
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT English Royalty
1 CONT House of Tudor
1 CONT
1 CONT Royal Coat of Arms
1 CONT Henry VII
1 CONT    Arthur, Prince of Wales
1 CONT    Margaret, Queen of Scots
