1 CONT   ** Note ** It has also been suggested that Agnes was the wife of William Edwardes, born ca. 1500 in England and died ca. 1547. The son Richard is the son that cannot be positively linked to William beucase records suggest that h
1 CONC e was born from another man, King Henry VIII. He is known as the "bastard child" of Agnes.
