1 CONT Other marriages: 
1 CONT VALOIS, Madeleine 
1 CONT DE GUISE-LORRAINE, Mary 
1 CONT
1 CONT Margaret ERSKINE was born date unknown. She died date unknown. She married James V (King of Scots) STEWART (mistress only). 
1 CONT
1 CONT They had the following children: 
