1 CONT    M i James (Earl of Moray) STEWART was born in 1531. He died 1 on 21 Jan 1570 in Linlithgow, Lothian SCT.  
1 CONT    M ii Robert (Earl of Orkney) STEWART was born about 1533. He died in 1591.  
