1 CONT Henry, Duke of Cornwall was the name of two sons of King Henry VIII of England and his first wife, Catherine of Aragon.
1 CONT Contents
1 CONT [hide]
1 CONT
1 CONT     * 1 The first Henry, Duke of Cornwall
1 CONT     * 2 The second Henry, Duke of Cornwall
