1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Mary I
1 CONT Queen of England and Ireland, Queen Consort of Aragon, Castile, and Naples, Consort of the Spanish Netherlands. (more...)
1 CONT Queen Mary I of Englandpainted in 1554 by Antonius MorMuseum of Prado, Madrid
1 CONT Queen Mary I of England
