1 CONT Counter-Reformation and of absolutist rule during the Thirty Years' War. He
1 CONT was cousin to brothers Rudolf and Matthias, emperors. At least Matthias was
1 CONT childless, whom Ferdinand succeeded. In 1619, he was deposed as King of
1 CONT Bohemia in favor of Frederick V, elector of the Palinate, but recovered the
1 CONT crown in 1620. See message under first wife.
